<section>
	<h2 id="footer">Footer</h2>
	<h3 id="footer-widgets">Footer Widgets</h3>
	<p>Choose the number and widths of footer columns in <b>Appearance &rarr; Customize &rarr; Footer &rarr; Layout</b>, using <b>Footer widgets layout</b>. Add the corresponding widgets to <b>Appearance &rarr; Widgets &rarr; Footer</b>. A layout with zero columns disables this widget area. Set its colors under <b>Footer &rarr; Colors</b>.</p>
	<h3 id="bottom-footer">Bottom Footer</h3>
	<p>Set the left and right footer text in <b>Appearance &rarr; Customize &rarr; Footer &rarr; Bottom Bar Content</b>. Jungle also provides a credits text field.</p>
	<h3 id="footer-extra-options">Footer skin options</h3>
	<p>Jungle and Haven have a <b>Footer &rarr; Footer Benefit Bar</b> visibility control. Jungle also has a <b>Footer &rarr; Back to Top</b> control for the button above the footer.</p>
</section>
